---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro'
---

<Layout title="Privacy policy">
    <section
        class="bg-neutral-white px-6 pt-36 pb-20 xl:px-[141px] xl:pt-36 xl:pb-32"
    >
        <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[1158px]">
            <h1
                class="text-[40px] leading-[48px] font-medium text-primary-violet xl:text-[56px] xl:leading-[64px]"
            >
                Privacy policy
            </h1>

            <div class="mt-8 max-w-[805px] xl:mt-14">
                <h2
                    class="text-[24px] leading-[32px] font-medium text-primary-violet xl:text-[28px] xl:leading-[36px]"
                >
                    Information Notice on the Processing of Personal Data
                </h2>

                <p
                    class="mt-7 text-[18px] leading-[28px] font-normal text-neutral-graphite"
                >
                    This information notice, provided pursuant to Regulation
                    (EU) 2016/679 (hereinafter, also "Regulation" or "GDPR"),
                    describes the processing of personal data of users
                    (hereinafter, "Data Subject(s)" or generically "User(s)")
                    who browse the information website of the Catalog of the
                    National Digital Data Platform referred to in Article
                    50-ter, paragraph 2, of Legislative Decree no. 82 of 7 March
                    2005 (hereinafter "Platform") accessible at the address
                    https://knodia.org (hereinafter, also the "Website"),
                    managed by PagoPA S.p.A. (hereinafter, also the "Company" or
                    the "Controller" or the "Website Manager").
                </p>

                <p
                    class="mt-7 text-[18px] leading-[28px] font-normal text-neutral-graphite"
                >
                    The validity of the information notice contained on this
                    page is limited to the Website and does not extend to other
                    websites, which may be consulted via hypertext links, even
                    if managed by the Company.
                </p>

                <h2
                    class="mt-14 text-[24px] leading-[32px] font-medium text-primary-violet xl:text-[28px] xl:leading-[36px]"
                >
                    Data Controller
                </h2>

                <p
                    class="mt-7 text-[18px] leading-[28px] font-normal text-neutral-graphite"
                >
                    The data controller is PagoPA S.p.A., with registered office
                    in Rome, Piazza Colonna n. 370, postal code - 00187,
                    registered with the Rome Company Register, Tax Code and VAT
                    number 15376371009. CEM:pagopa@pec.governo.it.
                </p>

                <p
                    class="mt-7 text-[18px] leading-[28px] font-normal text-neutral-graphite"
                >
                    For any request concerning the processing of personal data,
                    please write using the dedicated form for managing data
                    subject requests.
                </p>

                <h2
                    class="mt-14 text-[24px] leading-[32px] font-medium text-primary-violet xl:text-[28px] xl:leading-[36px]"
                >
                    Data Protection Officer
                </h2>

                <p
                    class="mt-7 text-[18px] leading-[28px] font-normal text-neutral-graphite"
                >
                    PagoPA S.p.A. has appointed its own Data Protection Officer
                    (DPO), pursuant to art. 37 of the Regulation, who can be
                    contacted using the contact form or at the following
                    address: Via Sardegna n. 38 - 00187, ROME (Company's
                    operational headquarters).
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</Layout>
